      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh heyyy, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Don’t\\nwork\\r\\ntoo\\r\\nhard\\r\\nout\\r\\nthere.\\r\\nRest\\r\\nis\\r\\nimportant, too![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
