    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "school_main_chara_languageteacher_02",
      "hash64": "05A587A7D5BE18E7",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]My dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Let’s\\ncommuniquer\\r\\na\\r\\nbit—\\r\\ncommunicate,\\r\\nthat is![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
